<ol>
  <li>Download Cortisol+ on a compatible iPhone and connect your Apple Watch through Apple Health.</li>
  <li>Choose which Health permissions to give. Missing permissions or not wearing the Watch much can mean less data.</li>
  <li>Open the dashboard and look at the factors behind the score. Check the HRV, resting heart rate and sleep records, not just the summary number.</li>
  <li>Compare your readings over time with notes about sleep, activity and how you feel.</li>
</ol>
